==Description==
The '''Mermaid Nametag''' is a nametag that is obtained by completing the ''The Little Medic'' [[Mission Quests|Mission]].

The '''Mermaid Nametag''' has a blue to pink gradient with blue water behind it. Various shells appear on top of the text. The text of the nametag has a unique font.

